# TRACKED, NOT IGNORED: docs/wiki/ and docs/raw/ - the LLM wiki layers are versioned on purpose, so
# wiki drift shows in the same git diff as code drift (docs/WikiDesign.md section 13, answer 3).
# The consequence, which is the reason for this note: the post-commit hook that enqueues targets
# from a diff MUST exclude both paths, or the ingest's own wiki: commit re-enqueues it forever (F9).
# Adding an ignore pattern for either folder would not fix that loop - it would only hide the drift.

